    <string name="gdpr_cancel_dialog_desc">In order to save game progress and bring you a better gaming experience, you have to agree to our latest Terms of Service, or you will exit the game.</string>
    <string name="gdpr_custom_content">With your consent, we would like to keep providing you with interest-based advertising based on your interactions and browsing habits on our app. Our offers are made possible by sharing such data with third-party partners.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt; You can withdraw your consent any time by either:&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;b&gt;· Downloading the AppChoices app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;    @ &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'app_choice\'&gt;www.aboutads.info/appchoices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;b&gt;· Adjusting your device settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;    Android (v.2.2+) / Google Play (v.4.0+): go to Google Settings - tap Ad - tap Opt-out of interest-based ads - tap OK.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt; To learn more, visit our updated &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'ad\'&gt;Cheetah Mobile Advertising Choices&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'policy\'&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'terms\'&gt;Terms of Service&lt;/a&gt;.</string>
    <string name="gdpr_custom_title">STAY INFORMED</string>
    <string name="gdpr_policy_content">We recently updated our &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'policy\'&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\'terms\'&gt;Terms of Service&lt;/a&gt; and encourage you to read them to understand how we process your personal data.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt; We have made the following changes to our Privacy Policy:&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;b&gt;· Purpose of Collection:&lt;/b&gt; We\'ve made it easier for you to understand the data we collect and how we use it.&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;b&gt;· Third Party Sharing:&lt;/b&gt; We describe the personal data we receive and share with third parties in greater detail.&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;b&gt;· Privacy Rights:&lt;/b&gt; For EEA users, we describe how we will honor your privacy rights under the &lt;b&gt;GDPR&lt;/b&gt;.</string>
    <string name="gdpr_policy_dialog_button">CONTINUE</string>
