    <string name="instructions">This is the AdMob in-app mediation test tool. If you\'ve provided a working AdMob App ID, it\'s already downloaded the mediation configurations for your app. You can browse them by network or ad unit, see whether the SDKs, adapters, and manifest entries are present, and even fire test requests. \n\nAny requests made by this tool will use the third party network placement IDs, app IDs, etc. you\'ve registered in the AdMob UI (or entered manually), so make sure they\'re configured with those networks for testing and otherwise in line with their policies.</string>
